Shared UI: packages/ui (@inflect/ui) and src/components/ui
-----------------------------------------------------------

packages/ui is a byte-for-byte copy of inflect-compliance's packages/ui at
commit 5528464fc54a8681956f3b9ce23ca9c075f0420e (BUSL-1.1, Inflect Ltd.).
The generic UI files under src/components/ui and src/lib/hooks (and the few
files they need, listed in ui-mirror.json) are byte-for-byte copies of the
same paths in inflect-compliance at the same commit, apart from three files
Islestone forked (PROVENANCE.md says how). Code copied from
inflect-compliance is not third-party code: it is BUSL-1.1 from the same
Licensor (ADR 0001, decision D1), and PROVENANCE.md records each copied file.
Two third-party components are inside it, taken as they are with the licence
risk accepted (ADR 0001, decision D4):

- Dub (github.com/dubinc/dub). Many of the package's charts, hooks, utilities
  and icons, and some of the src/components/ui primitives (the filter system,
  the combobox, the date-picker types, the table types, label and
  animated-size-container among them), derive from Dub's packages/ui and
  packages/utils; PROVENANCE.md marks each such file.
  Copyright (c) 2024-present Dub Technologies, Inc.
  Licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 (AGPL-3.0),
  outside Dub's (ee) folders. The licence text is at
  https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.txt and in Dub's LICENSE.md.

- Nucleo icons, packages/ui/src/components/ui/icons/nucleo/.
  Copyright © Nucleo. Redistribution of the icons is prohibited; they are
  restricted for use only within the product they are bundled with
  (https://nucleoapp.com/license). The folder's README.md, which carries the
